# Hash-locked runtime + test closure for every test, lint and migration job in
# .github/workflows/compiler.yml. The top-level pins stay in
# requirements-test.txt, which mirrors [project.optional-dependencies].test.
# Regenerate test.txt whenever requirements.txt or requirements-test.txt
# changes (tests/test_ci_requirements_lock.py fails on drift):
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 \
#     --constraint requirements/ci/runtime.txt \
#     requirements/ci/test.in -o requirements/ci/test.txt
-r ../../requirements-test.txt
